%% Proposed alternative. A2UI describes UI; application still owns transport.
flowchart LR
  PY[Python chain and exact tools] --> RS[ResultSets and EvidenceRefs]
  RS --> VP[Validated domain view plan]
  VP --> A[Server A2UI v0.9.1 adapter]
  A --> S[Application-owned SSE transport]
  S --> L[Surface lifecycle and binding state]
  L --> R[React A2UI renderer]
  CAT[Bundled allowlisted domain catalog] --> R
  R --> UI[Multi-panel surface with narrative and citations]
  UI -->|allowlisted action intent| PY
  CAT -. charts maps and citations require custom wrappers .-> VP
